<!-- ============ STUDIO INTRODUCTION ============ -->
<section class="intro" id="about">
  <div class="intro__inner">
    <h2>A Creative Studio for Singers &amp; Artists</h2>
    <p>Music has been a part of who I am for as long as I can remember. As a singer, songwriter, producer, performer, educator, and content creator, I love helping people discover their voice and develop their creativity.</p>
    <p>At Jerrica Music Studio, I work with students and artists of all ages and experience levels &mdash; from someone taking their very first lesson to experienced performers and independent artists looking to take their craft further.</p>
    <p>My approach is energetic, compassionate, structured, and personalized. Every student has different goals, strengths, and challenges, so I build a plan around the individual rather than following a one-size-fits-all formula.</p>
    <p>Whether you want to become a stronger singer, prepare for an audition or performance, write and record your own music, develop as an artist, or build your presence online &mdash; I'm here to help you grow.</p>
    <p class="intro__closing">This is a place to chase your creative goals &mdash; not just take a weekly singing lesson.</p>
  </div>
</section>

