<!-- ============ VOCAL COACHING ============ -->
<section class="coaching" id="services">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="coaching__head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Vocal Coaching</div>
      <h2>Build Your Voice. Build Your Confidence.</h2>
      <p>Whether you're taking your very first singing lesson or you're an experienced singer refining your craft, lessons are tailored to your individual voice, goals, and experience level. I specialize in Pop, R&amp;B, and contemporary vocal styles, with a strong focus on vocal technique, confidence, performance, and helping each singer develop their own unique sound.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="coaching__grid">
      <div class="coaching__photo">
        <img src="/images/coaching.jpg" alt="Vocal coaching at the piano">
      </div>
      <div class="coaching__details">
        <h3>Lessons can include</h3>
        <div class="coaching__pills">
          <div class="pill">Vocal technique</div>
          <div class="pill">Breath support</div>
          <div class="pill">Range development</div>
          <div class="pill">Chest, head &amp; mixed voice</div>
          <div class="pill">Belting</div>
          <div class="pill">Agility, runs &amp; melisma</div>
          <div class="pill">Song interpretation</div>
          <div class="pill">Performance &amp; stage presence</div>
          <div class="pill">Audition prep</div>
          <div class="pill">Competition prep</div>
          <div class="pill">Recording prep</div>
          <div class="pill">On-camera performance</div>
          <div class="pill">Confidence building</div>
          <div class="pill">Artist development</div>
        </div>
        <p>A lesson typically begins with a conversation about your goals, followed by breathing and vocal warm-up work and an assessment of the voice. From there, we work on a section of a song you've shared, choosing material that fits your voice and goals.</p>
        <div class="coaching__note">
          <p>Your lesson doesn't end when the Zoom call ends.</p>
          <p>Lessons are recorded so you can return to them while practicing, and after each one you'll receive directed practice instructions plus a personalized Google Drive folder of notes, resources, links, and recordings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

